package System
  part Data
    let x in boolean 
    let y in  boolean 
  part

  part Fonctional 
    let x in boolean 
  part

  part Physical
    let x in real 
  part

  requirement R1 top on Data via Fonctional is
    not Data::x and Data::y
  requirement

  requirement R2 on Fonctional derives R1 via Physical is
    Fonctional::x
  requirement


  requirement R3 bottom on Physical derives R2 is
    Physical::x > 0
  requirement
package
